{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, approach, grab it, check, and complete task. Else, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanSurroundings    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRobotHand    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
